  "solution": "Phương pháp đổi biến số:<br>\n\t\tNếu <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo minsize=\"1.2\" maxsize=\"1.2\" stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo minsize=\"1.2\" maxsize=\"1.2\" stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, trong đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là hàm số có đạo hàm liên tục trên đoạn <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></munderover><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></munderover>